title: sensor_ghost_start
tags: nebula
---
Your sensors go wild. You see a massive fleet surrounding you—hundreds of Ark ships. But your visual scanners show nothing. The nebula is psycho-reactive; it's projecting your crew's hopes onto the radar. #line:sensor_ghost_start_00
-> Calibrate Sensors #line:sensor_ghost_start_01
    <<add_fact research_points 100>>
    <<stop>>
-> Hail Them #line:sensor_ghost_start_02
    <<jump sensor_ghost_sanity_break>>
-> Harvest Gas #line:sensor_ghost_start_03
    <<give_item item_psycho_gas 1>>
    <<give_credits 250>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: sensor_ghost_sanity_break
tags: 
---
You hail the ghosts. The static screams back with the voices of your dead relatives. The crew panics. #line:sensor_ghost_sanity_break_00
-> Continue <<if has_item("resource_crew", 1)>> #line:sensor_ghost_sanity_break_01
    <<set_fact trait_shaken true>>
    <<take_item resource_crew 1>>
    <<stop>>
